{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Fees and Related Matters in Software License Agreements"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about fees in software license agreements."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understands information about people's backgrounds in spoken or written documents.  Participates in the improvement of IT contracts, establishing technical clauses that respond to the needs of the negotiating agents, based on current laws on contracting."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.  Recognizes simple ideas on concepts on IT contracts and knowledge transfer, simulated processes of IT contracting, and technological negotiation."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "applicable rate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a particular scale of numerical succession used to determine a charge, fee, tax or similar"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I calculate them on a time and material basis using applicable rates."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "derive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to obtain from"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Based on the kind of software you just acquired, this cost reflects the value you can derive from using it."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "market conditions"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "characteristics of a market into which a product or service is introduced"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Well, I'll let you know when I adjust these fees to the inflation and the changes in the market's conditions.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tax"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mandatory monetary contribution to the government's revenue from the economic activity of an individual or organization"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Understood. Now I want to know if I need to worry about taxes and withholdings."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "usage right"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the legal right to use a property, product or service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These fees are normally based on the duration and scope of the software usage rights granted to you by the software license agreement you just signed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "withholdings"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "charge on a citizen's activity to support the government's expenses"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Understood. Now I want to know if I need to worry about taxes and withholdings."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Questions Within Statements"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In declarative statements there is sometimes a <span class=\"strong\">question that is embedded or included</span>. In fact, it is used to ask for further information or to complement another idea."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I see, but I'd like to know why that price is so high."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wonder how the additional services are estimated."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'd like to know if these fees are going to increase."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Now I want to know if I need to worry about taxes and withholdings."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p align=\"justify\">Contrary to traditional interrogative structures, in which word order is reversed, in the <span class=\"strong\">questions within statements</span> the subject follows the typical affirmative structure. Plus, the auxiliaries that we commonly use in traditional questions are avoided.<br /><br />   Remember that the <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> is a statement, and as such, it ends with a period and not a question mark. </p>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Kinds of Fees in a Software License Agreement "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Sometimes in the software license agreement customers are required to pay various kinds of fees: "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Check the following chart to learn about the most common fees that we, as customers, pay when we purchase a software: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">SOFTWARE  LICENSE  FEE </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This fee reflects the cost the customer will procure from using the licensed software, depending on the duration of the software license and the scope of the software usage rights. This kind of fees can be paid in advance, on either a one-time basis or a periodic basis.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">SOFTWARE MAINTENANCE AND TECHNICAL SUPPORT FEE </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This kind of fee reflects the type and reach of those services and their perceived value to the customer. These fees are usually calculated using a formula and are normally payable in advance or on a periodic basis. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">FEES  FOR  ADDITIONAL SERVICES </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Additional services, like software implementation and training, are charged by vendors. They are usually based on a fee schedule or determined on a time and materials basis using the software vendor's applicable rates.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about fees for software license agreements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the procedure about how to establish them, facts that affect final fee and the  enforcement of them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a guide for customers to help them understand basic concepts and the fees they are obligated to pay for."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the guide with my classmates."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for information about fees."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe them in a simple way for customers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a customer's guide in order to make them understand the fees dynamic."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the guide with my classmates."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about the considerations to e