oup_name", "content": "Activity 3"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "EXT", "template_override": 1, "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le03ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n7le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vendor</span>: So, Mrs. Jones, all we have left is for you to pay for the software license and the related services.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Ok. I know I have to pay for the software license, but I'm not sure what the other fees are for.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vendor</span>: Well, Mrs. Jones. These fees are normally based on the duration and scope of the software usage rights granted to you by the software license agreement you just signed.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: I see, but I'd like to know why that price is so high.<br /><br />"}, {"time": "34000", "image": "enpe8n7le03ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vendor</span>: Based on the kind of software you just acquired, this cost reflects the value you can derive from using it.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: What about the fee for software maintenance and technical support? I wonder how the additional services are estimated.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vendor</span>: For technical support, you can always make a limited number of requests; and, regarding the additional services, such as required software implementation and training, I calculate them on a time and material basis using applicable rates.<br /><br />"}, {"time": "69500", "image": "enpe8n7le03ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: I'd like to know if these fees are going to increase.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vendor</span>: Well, I'll let you know when I adjust these fees to the inflation and the changes in the market's conditions.  Since this software license agreement imposes time-limited restrictions, you're going to have to pay a little more once the license has expired.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Understood. Now I want to know if I need to worry about taxes and withholdings.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vendor</span>: This license doesn't include applicable taxes and you can pay fees without any deduction or withholding. But, for this software enforcement, a periodical reactivation is needed. In order to do that you'll need some license codes we provide you with, and for that it is mandatory for you to pay the corresponding fees.<br />"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}